{"name":"Wild Life","hex":"#a5c1c0","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"wild life","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Dated spelling of wildlife.","Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see wild,‎ life."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wild_life"}],"entries":[{"title":"The Wild Life (film)","blocks":[{"text":"The Wild Life is a 1984 American coming-of-age comedy film directed by Art Linson and written by Cameron Crowe. The film stars Chris Penn, Lea Thompson, Ilan Mitchell-Smith, Jenny Wright, Eric Stoltz, Rick Moranis, Hart Bochner, and Randy Quaid."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d1/The_Wild_Life_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Wild_Life_(film)"},{"title":"Wild Life (Wings album)","blocks":[{"text":"Wild Life is the debut studio album by the British-American rock band Wings and the third studio album by Paul McCartney after the break-up of the Beatles. The album was mainly recorded in late July 1971, with additional overdub sessions in September and October, at EMI Studios in London. The line-up consisted of McCartney, his wife Linda, session drummer Denny Seiwell, whom the duo had worked with on their previous album Ram, and guitarist Denny Laine, formerly of the English rock band the Moody Blues. Paul McCartney's goal for the album was to record the songs quickly, in a few takes and with minimal overdubs."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e9/Wings%2C_Wild_Life_%281971%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wild_Life_(Wings_album)"},{"title":"Wild Life (Hedley album)","blocks":[{"text":"Wild Life is the fifth studio album by Canadian pop/rock band Hedley. It was released via Universal Music Canada on November 11, 2013, in Canada, while the album was via Capitol Records in the US on May 19, 2014. The album debuted and peaked at No. 4 on the Canadian Albums Chart. It sold 64,000 copies in Canada in 2013. Wild Life was certified Platinum by Music Canada on March 10, 2014."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wild_Life_(Hedley_album)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d1/The_Wild_Life_film_poster.jpg/250px-The_Wild_Life_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d1/The_Wild_Life_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d1/The_Wild_Life_film_poster.jpg/250px-The_Wild_Life_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThe_Wild_Life_film_poster.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/e9/Wings%2C_Wild_Life_%281971%29.png/250px-Wings%2C_Wild_Life_%281971%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e9/Wings%2C_Wild_Life_%281971%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/e9/Wings%2C_Wild_Life_%281971%29.png/250px-Wings%2C_Wild_Life_%281971%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWings%2C_Wild_Life_(1971).png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/Linda_McCartney_and_husband_Paul_1976.jpg/500px-Linda_McCartney_and_husband_Paul_1976.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/Linda_McCartney_and_husband_Paul_1976.jpg/1280px-Linda_McCartney_and_husband_Paul_1976.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/Linda_McCartney_and_husband_Paul_1976.jpg/500px-Linda_McCartney_and_husband_Paul_1976.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Paul and Linda McCartney in 1976","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALinda_McCartney_and_husband_Paul_1976.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Abbey_Rd_Studios.jpg/500px-Abbey_Rd_Studios.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Abbey_Rd_Studios.jpg/1280px-Abbey_Rd_Studios.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Abbey_Rd_Studios.jpg/500px-Abbey_Rd_Studios.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Wild Life was recorded entirely at London's EMI Studios (pictured in 2007).","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAbbey_Rd_Studios.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/65/Wild_Life_by_Hedley.jpg/250px-Wild_Life_by_Hedley.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/65/Wild_Life_by_Hedley.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/65/Wild_Life_by_Hedley.jpg/250px-Wild_Life_by_Hedley.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWild_Life_by_Hedley.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}